<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1834199161"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:41.773"><div begin="23.067" end="46.269" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.067" end="28.751" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.067" end="23.869">我不</span><span begin="23.869" end="25.573">是</span><span begin="26.400" end="27.117">好演</span><span begin="27.117" end="28.751">员</span></p><p begin="29.525" end="34.580" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.525" end="30.384">才笑</span><span begin="30.384" end="31.523">着</span><span begin="32.742" end="33.678">却掉</span><span begin="33.678" end="34.580">泪</span></p><p begin="36.022" end="40.730" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.022" end="36.863">亲爱</span><span begin="36.863" end="38.388">的</span><span begin="39.269" end="40.053">别内</span><span begin="40.053" end="40.730">疚</span></p><p begin="40.872" end="46.269" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.872" end="41.674">和平</span><span begin="41.674" end="42.476">分</span><span begin="42.476" end="43.100">手</span> <span begin="43.415" end="44.937">好过难看</span><span begin="44.937" end="45.757">牵</span><span begin="45.757" end="46.269">手</span></p></div><div begin="46.611" end="1:10.064" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="46.611" end="52.486" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.611" end="47.859">爱原来</span><span begin="47.859" end="48.309">变</span><span begin="48.309" end="49.605">淡</span> <span begin="49.808" end="51.425">味道会变</span><span begin="51.425" end="52.486">酸</span></p><p begin="53.023" end="58.969" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.023" end="54.712">小小的遗</span><span begin="54.712" end="55.294">憾</span> <span begin="55.576" end="56.678">还算喜</span><span begin="56.678" end="57.444">剧</span><span begin="57.444" end="57.949">收</span><span begin="57.949" end="58.969">场</span></p><p begin="59.502" end="1:06.131" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.502" end="1:01.182">虽然我们</span><span begin="1:01.228" end="1:01.970">的<